      "page_end": 1,
      "char_start": 3708,
      "char_end": 3989,
      "excerpt": "The transvaginal approach is the preferred method\nto perform an adequate high-resolution targeted\nneurosonographic examination. When this is not\ntechnically feasible (e.g. breech presentation; twin preg-\nnancy), the examination is performed transabdominally\n(GOOD PRACTICE POINT ).",
      "excerpt_sha256": "c065724e92c651ce165f40107f52269f31eecd6ccce2dcc9794ad006b0166d40",
      "proposed_role": "method_and_feasibility",
